#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:64 imageeffect_restoration.cpp:72
msgid "Photograph Restoration"
msgstr "Restaurazón de Fotografias"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:74
msgid "A digiKam image plugin to restore a photograph."
msgstr "Un plugin de digiKam para restaurar unha fotografia."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:80
msgid "Author and maintainer"
msgstr "Autoria e mantimento"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:83
msgid "CImg library"
msgstr "Biblioteca CImg"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:86
msgid "Feedback and plugin polishing"
msgstr "Reaczóns e polimento do plugin"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:97
msgid "Preset"
msgstr "Predefinizón"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:105
msgid "Visit CImg library website"
msgstr "Visite a Páxina Web da biblioteca CImg"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:107
msgid "Filtering type:"
msgstr "Tipo de filtraxe:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:109
msgid "None"
msgstr "Nengun"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:110
msgid "Reduce Uniform Noise"
msgstr "Reducir o Ruído Uniforme"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:111
msgid "Reduce JPEG Artefacts"
msgstr "Reducir os Artefactos JPEG"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:112
msgid "Reduce Texturing"
msgstr "Reducir a Texturizazón"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:113
msgid ""
"<p>Select here the filter preset to use for photograph restoration:"
"<p><b>None</b>: Most common values. Puts settings to default."
"<p><b>Reduce Uniform Noise</b>: reduce small image artefacts like sensor noise."
"<p><b>Reduce JPEG Artefacts</b>: reduce large image artefacts like JPEG "
"compression mosaic."
"<p><b>Reduce Texturing</b>: reduce image artefacts like paper texture or Moire "
"patterns of a scanned image."
"<p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Escolla aqui o filtro predefinido a usar na restaurazón de fotografias:"
"<p><b>Nengun</b>: Os valores mais comuns. Coloca as opzóns cos valores "
"predefinidos."
"<p><b>Reducir o Ruído Uniforme</b>: reduce os artefactos pequenos da imaxe, "
"como o ruído do sensor."
"<p><b>Reducir os Artefactos JPEG</b>: reduz os artefactos de imaxe maiores, "
"como o mosaico da compresión JPEG."
"<p><b>Reducir a Texturizazón</b>: reduce os artefactos de imaxe, como a textura "
"de papel ou os patróns Moire dunha imaxe dixitalizada."
"<p>"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:129
msgid "Smoothing"
msgstr "Suavizazón"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:131
msgid "Detail preservation:"
msgstr "Preservazón dos detalles:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:135
msgid ""
"<p>Preservation of details to set the sharpening level of the small features in "
"the target image. Higher values leave details sharp."
msgstr ""
"<p>A preservazón dos detalles define o nível de afinamento dos pequenos "
"detalles na imaxe obxectivo. Os valores mais altos deixan os detalles ben "
"definidos."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:141
msgid "Anisotropy:"
msgstr "Anisotropia:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:145
msgid ""
"<p>Anisotropic (directional) modifier of the details. Keep it small for "
"Gaussian noise."
msgstr ""
"<p>Modificador anisotrópico (direccional) dos detalles. Deixe-o baixo para "
"obter un ruído Gausiano."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:149
msgid "Smoothing:"
msgstr "Suavizazón:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:153
msgid ""
"<p>Total smoothing power: if Detail Factor sets the relative smoothing and "
"Gradient Factor the direction, Time Step sets the overall effect."
msgstr ""
"<p>Poténcia de suavizazón total: se o Factor de Detalle define a suavizazón "
"relativa e o Factor Gradiente a direczón, o Paso Temporal define o efeito "
"global."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:158
msgid "Regularity:"
msgstr "Regularidade:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:162
msgid ""
"<p>This value controls the smoothing regularity of the target image. Do not use "
"an high value here, or the target image will be completely blurred."
msgstr ""
"<p>Este valor controla a regularidade de suavizazón da imaxe final. Non use un "
"valor alto aqui, ou a imaxe final quedará completamente borrada."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:168
msgid "Iterations:"
msgstr "Iterazóns:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:172
msgid "<p>Sets the number of times the filter is applied on the target image."
msgstr "<p>Define o número de veces que o filtro é aplicado na imaxe final."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:180
msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "Configurazón Avanzada"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:182
msgid "Angular step:"
msgstr "Paso angular:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:186
msgid ""
"<p>Set here the angular integration step in degrees in analogy to anisotropy."
msgstr ""
"<p>Defina aqui o paso de integrazón angular en graus, en analoxia coa "
"anisotropia."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:190
msgid "Integral step:"
msgstr "Paso integral:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:194
msgid "<p>Set here the spatial integral step. Stay below 1."
msgstr "<p>Defina aqui o paso integral espacial. Manteña-o menor que 1."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:198
msgid "Gaussian:"
msgstr "Gausiano:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:202
msgid "<p>Set here the precision of the Gaussian function."
msgstr "<p>Defina aqui a precisión da funzón gausiana."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:206
msgid "Use linear interpolation"
msgstr "Usar a interpolazón linear"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:207
msgid "<p>Enable this option to quench the last bit of quality (slow)."
msgstr ""
"<p>Active esta opzón para aproveitar o último ponto de calidade (lento)."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:210
msgid "Normalize photograph"
msgstr "Normalizar a fotografia"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:211
msgid "<p>Enable this option to process an output image normalization."
msgstr "<p>Active esta opzón para facer unha normalizazón na imaxe final."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:399
msgid "Restoration"
msgstr "Restaurazón"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:407
msgid "Photograph Restoration Settings File to Load"
msgstr "Arquivo de Configurazón da Restaurazón de Fotografias a Carregar"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:419
msgid "\"%1\" is not a Photograph Restoration settings text file."
msgstr "\"%1\" non é un ficheiro de configurazón da restaurazón de fotografia."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:441
msgid "Cannot load settings from the Photograph Restoration text file."
msgstr ""
"Non foi posíbel configurar as opzóns co ficheiro de restaurazón das "
"fotografias."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:450
msgid "Photograph Restoration Settings File to Save"
msgstr "Guardando o Arquivo de Configurazón da Restaurazón de Fotografias"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:472
msgid "Cannot save settings to the Photograph Restoration text file."
msgstr ""
"Non foi posíbel guardar as opzóns no ficheiro de texto de restaurazón das "
"fotografias."

#: imageplugin_restoration.cpp:42
msgid "Restoration..."
msgstr "Restaurazón..."

